{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#1424","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#1424","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#1424\",\"parent_revision\":\"030286cc2c82965f33a7502c6cadf509bd82381a\",\"root_revision\":\"b5743bd86e63f6d00a47fb781b0f258e1e2f8150d7d02cac2fa9c06569db24a5\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: P1\\ntype: Feature\\nstatus: open\\nadded: 2026-08-12\\n-->\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- [ ] `agents/knowledge-compounder.md` exists in `plugins/development-harness/`\\n- [ ] `_PHASE_DEFINITIONS` in `sam_schema/core/quality_gates.py` includes T7 with `agent: \\\"knowledge-compounder\\\"` and `dependencies: [\\\"T6\\\"]`\\n- [ ] `_phase_body` titles dict in `quality_gates.py` includes phase 7\\n- [ ] `dh_paths.py` has `learnings_dir()` function; `ensure_dirs` creates `~/.dh/projects/{slug}/learnings/`\\n- [ ] `complete-implementation` SKILL.md phase table updated to include T7; skip whitelist updated to allow T7 skip\\n- [ ] After `/complete-implementation` on a non-trivial feature: file exists at `~/.dh/projects/{slug}/learnings/{feature-slug}-compound.md` with at least one Problem/Solution pair and one Architectural Decision\\n- [ ] `sam_status` shows T7 as `complete` or `skipped`\\n- [ ] `uv run pytest plugins/development-harness/ -x` exits 0 (test_quality_gates.py updated for 7-task plan)\\n- [ ] `uv run ty check plugins/development-harness/` exits 0\\n</div>\\n\\n## Story\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nAs a **developer using Claude Code skills**, I want to **knowledge compounding \u2014 capture solved-problem artifacts after implementation** so that **the tooling becomes more capable and complete**.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: Research entry: ./research/skill-generation-tools/compound-engineering-plugin.md \u2014 pattern: Cyclical improvement flywheel with /ce:compound knowledge capture\\n- **Priority**: P1\\n- **Added**: 2026-04-01\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\\n## Groomed (2026-04-04)\\n\\n### Priority\\n\\nP1 \u2014 confirmed. No learnings infrastructure exists. T6 already captures discoveries in the plan YAML; T7 extracts and structures them into a standalone, searchable artifact.\\n\\n### Scope\\n\\nIn scope:\\n- New `knowledge-compounder` agent that reads T1\u2013T6 outputs and produces a structured compound document\\n- `learnings_dir()` in `dh_paths.py` + `ensure_dirs` update\\n- T7 entry in `_PHASE_DEFINITIONS` and `_phase_body` titles\\n- SKILL.md phase table and skip whitelist update\\n- `test_quality_gates.py` update for 7-task plan structure\\n\\nOut of scope:\\n- Indexing/search infrastructure for S2 Planning lookups (Phase 2 of this feature)\\n- Proportional QG plan (3-task path) \u2014 T7 is full plan only\\n- \\\"Trivial implementation\\\" auto-detection for skip \u2014 implementer judgment at runtime\\n\\n### Files\\n\\nCREATE:\\n- `plugins/development-harness/agents/knowledge-compounder.md` \u2014 new agent\\n\\nMODIFY:\\n- `plugins/development-harness/sam_schema/core/quality_gates.py` \u2014 add T7 to `_PHASE_DEFINITIONS` (line ~73), update `_phase_body` titles dict\\n- `plugins/development-harness/backlog_core/dh_paths.py` \u2014 add `learnings_dir()`, update `ensure_dirs`\\n- `plugins/development-harness/skills/complete-implementation/SKILL.md` \u2014 add T7 to phase table (line ~452), update skip whitelist at line 543\\n\\nUPDATE:\\n- `plugins/development-harness/tests/test_quality_gates.py` \u2014 update assertions from 6-task to 7-task plan\\n\\n### Dependencies\\n\\nNone \u2014 T7 is additive; no existing interfaces change.\\n\\n## Target State\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nA new Phase T7 (\\\"Knowledge Compound\\\") executes after T6 (Context Refinement) passes. A `knowledge-compounder` agent:\\n\\n1. Reads the implementation plan, task files, code-reviewer findings, and feature-verifier output\\n2. Produces a knowledge artifact at `~/.dh/projects/{slug}/learnings/{feature-slug}-compound.md` containing:\\n   - Problems encountered and their solutions (with file paths)\\n   - Architectural decisions made and their rationale\\n   - Patterns discovered that could be reused\\n   - Anti-patterns encountered that should be avoided\\n3. The artifact is indexed so future planning phases (S2 Planning) can search past learnings when working on related features\\n\\nThe `build_quality_gate_plan` function adds T7 with dependency on T6. T7 is skippable (like T5) when the implementation was trivial.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Measurable Signal\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nAfter running `/complete-implementation` on a non-trivial feature, a file exists at `~/.dh/projects/{slug}/learnings/{feature-slug}-compound.md`. The file contains at least one \\\"Problem/Solution\\\" pair and one \\\"Architectural Decision\\\" entry. Running `sam_status` on the QG plan shows T7 with status `complete` or `skipped`.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Current State\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nAfter `complete-implementation` finishes all 6 quality gate phases and applies the `status:verified` label, the workflow ends. No step captures what was learned during the implementation \u2014 architectural decisions made, problems encountered and solved, patterns discovered, or reusable solutions. The T6 (Context Refinement) phase updates context files but stores discoveries inside the plan YAML via `sam_update` \u2014 not as a standalone indexed artifact. No `learnings/` directory convention exists in `dh_paths.py`. Knowledge from completed features is lost across sessions.\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"6ec2d7f1f0c3475874377753997cd08b6ddede00c4cbce5362f6303270c5151b\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABPnOwGQ\"}"}